@startuml
title Figure 1. High-level system architecture

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "User" as U
component "User Interface\n(Frontend)" as UI
component "Backend Server\n(FastAPI)" as BE
queue "Broker Layer\n(Redis/Celery)" as MQ
component "Analytical Workflow\n(LSG pipeline)" as AW
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

U --> UI : Interaction
UI --> BE : HTTP API
BE --> DB : Status and results
BE --> MQ : Enqueue task
MQ --> AW : Asynchronous processing
AW --> DB : Write results
BE --> UI : Status and results
@enduml
